00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:26,920
Because some of you may have seen this stuff before,

288
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,500
or might come up and ask,

289
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,240
"So why aren't you teaching us the Harvard architecture?"

